<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-3325] .NET: Improve CompiledQuery in LINQ provider</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-3325</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;User reported that the following code fails with &quot;Error compiling query: all compiled query arguments should come from enclosing delegate parameters.&quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;Func&amp;lt;&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;int&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;int&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;int&lt;/span&gt;,IQueryCursor&amp;lt;ICacheEntry&amp;lt;&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;int&lt;/span&gt;, OrderEntity&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&amp;gt; qry = 
                CompiledQuery.Compile((&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;int&lt;/span&gt; x, &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;int&lt;/span&gt; y,&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;int&lt;/span&gt; z) =&amp;gt; orderCache.AsCacheQueryable().Where(e =&amp;gt; e.Value.OrderId % x == z).Take(y));
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Other limitations are:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Embedded parameters are not supported&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Maximum number of parameters is 8&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;We should provide additional additional method to compile a delegate which takes an array of args.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
